MtMoon_B2F_Text_MiguelIntro::
    .string "Hey, stop!\p"
    .string "I found these fossils!\n"
    .string "They're both mine!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_MiguelDefeat::
    .string "Okay!\n"
    .string "I'll share!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_WellEachTakeAFossil::
    .string "We'll each take a fossil!\n"
    .string "No being greedy!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_ThenThisFossilIsMine::
    .string "All right.\n"
    .string "Then this fossil is mine!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_LabOnCinnabarRegeneratesFossils::
    .string "Far away, on CINNABAR ISLAND,\n"
    .string "there's a POKéMON LAB.\p"
    .string "They do research on regenerating\n"
    .string "fossils.$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "We, TEAM ROCKET, shall find the\n"
    .string "fossils!\p"
    .string "Reviving POKéMON from them will\n"
    .string "earn us huge riches!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "Urgh!\n"
    .string "Now I'm mad!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "You made me mad!\n"
    .string "TEAM ROCKET will blacklist you!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "We, TEAM ROCKET, are POKéMON\n"
    .string "gangsters!\l"
    .string "We strike fear with our strength!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "I blew it!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
    .string "Darn it all!\n"
    .string "My associates won't stand for this!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt3Intro::
    .string "We're pulling a big job here!\n"
    .string "Get lost, kid!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt3Defeat::
    .string "So, you are good…$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt3PostBattle::
    .string "If you find a fossil, give it to me\n"
    .string "and scram!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt4Intro::
    .string "Little kids shouldn't be messing\n"
    .string "around with grown-ups!\p"
    .string "It could be bad news!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt4Defeat::
    .string "I'm steamed!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt4PostBattle::
    .string "POKéMON lived here long before\n"
    .string "people came.$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_YouWantDomeFossil::
    .string "Do you want the DOME FOSSIL?$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_YouWantHelixFossil::
    .string "Do you want the HELIX FOSSIL?$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_ObtainedHelixFossil::
    .string "Obtained the HELIX FOSSIL!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_ObtainedDomeFossil::
    .string "Obtained the DOME FOSSIL!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_JessieJamesStop::
    .string "Freeze, twerp!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_JessieJamesIntro::
    .string "JESSIE: The MOON STONE, the\n"
    .string "fossils AND a super PIKACHU!\p"
    .string "JAMES: Hand them over nicely, or\n"
    .string "we'll take them not so nicely!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_JessieJamesDefeat::
    .string "Beaten by a kid in a cave…$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_JessieJamesBlastOff::
    .string "JESSIE & JAMES: This isn't over!\n"
    .string "MEOWTH: …It kinda is, for today.$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_ClefairyDancing::
    .string "CLEFAIRY are dancing in a circle\n"
    .string "around a MOON STONE…\p"
    .string "Stay still and watch?$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_ClefairyScattered::
    .string "{PLAYER} took a step…\p"
    .string "The startled CLEFAIRY scattered!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_ClefableCameCloser::
    .string "The dance ended.\n"
    .string "A CLEFABLE came closer!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_ClefableHeldOutMoonStone::
    .string "CLEFABLE held out a MOON STONE!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_NoRoomForMoonStone::
    .string "…But there was no room for it.\n"
    .string "CLEFABLE looked disappointed.$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_ClefableAttacked::
    .string "CLEFABLE seems to want to test\n"
    .string "{PLAYER}'s strength!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_ShootingStarFell::
    .string "A shooting star streaked across the\n"
    .string "cave and fell where the dance was!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_StarIsTwinkling::
    .string "Something is twinkling where the\n"
    .string "star fell…\p"
    .string "It opened its eyes!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_JessieFollowClefairy::
    .string "JESSIE: There it is! Follow that\n"
    .string "CLEFAIRY and it'll lead us right\l"
    .string "to the MOON STONE!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_JamesMoonStone::
    .string "JAMES: A stone fallen from the\n"
    .string "moon itself… The BOSS will adore\l"
    .string "it. And the fossils, of course!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_MeowthRemembersPikachu::
    .string "MEOWTH: Hey, it's the twerp from\n"
    .string "VIRIDIAN with the super PIKACHU!\p"
    .string "Two prizes in one cave. Today's\n"
    .string "our lucky day!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_ClefairyGrateful::
    .string "The CLEFAIRY TEAM ROCKET was\n"
    .string "chasing hopped over.\p"
    .string "It set something shiny down at\n"
    .string "your feet!$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_ClefairyHopsAway::
    .string "CLEFAIRY hopped off happily into\n"
    .string "the dark.$"

MtMoon_B2F_Text_ClefairyRemembersYou::
    .string "CLEFAIRY: Pippi!\p"
    .string "It's the CLEFAIRY that TEAM ROCKET\n"
    .string "was after. It seems to remember\l"
    .string "you drove them off.$"
